      "targetText": "Actual PBPS ambient adjoint and globally centered correctorFan Chen,Sinho Chewi,Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang; printed intrinsic block-adjoint/first-corrector domain realized on the actual joint space. ASTIS supplements the explicit ambient extension,centering and norm-budget integration; not a new printed standalone theorem.arXiv:2609.06905v1;Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · PBPS2609.06905v1 Appendix B3 first-corrector paragraph after B16, before B20/B21; intrinsic block adjoint versus canonical ambient extension; original inputs and actual jointly centered observable. · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)Let E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including the explicit rank-zero extension. Let V:E→ℝ be C², 0<α≤β, and assum",
